  file_section
    defined-by concept
    role file_section_noun
    precondition "an additive edit places its text at one end of a Markdown section named by its quoted heading"
    effect "the section runs from its heading to the line before the next heading of the same or a higher level"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "insert the line 'x' at the end of the section '## Usage' in README.md"
