  file_edit_all_occurrences
    defined-by relation
    role file_edit_all_occurrences_cue
    precondition "a replace request states that every occurrence of the old text is meant"
    effect "the cue is no part of the old or new text; every occurrence is replaced, which a replace does by default (PR #1188 G84)"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "replace 'a' with 'b' everywhere"
